          "rating": 5,
          "text": "My first time for coming here at night after watching supertree grove light & music show.\n\nSeem crowded but when u order & paying by self system was easy & wait for the food wasn't too long. The place is safe & comfortable though it's not very large.\n\nDining option when you're confused about what u want to eat 🫠",
