        },
        {
          "author": "S L",
          "rating": 4,
          "text": "Gardens by the Bay outlet has indoor & outdoor seating. The indoor was full but I managed to find a seat. Ordered from the kiosk, paid at the counter, got my ice cream in under 3 mins. Thick and good!",
          "relativeTime": "a month ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJAkIMqVKd0FXBmnlEDQ3qr5j4y_PN5Apphat0ihu-u1RSNQw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
        },
        {
          "author": "Potato Head",
          "rating": 2,
          "text": "Visited on a Saturday afternoon, and surprisingly it was not overly crowded.\n\nHowever, the overall operation did not feel very smooth. The sauce for the nuggets was forgotten, and the muffin I ordered was replaced with a different type of bun by mistake.\n\nWhile none of the issues were major individually, the repeated small errors gave the impression that the outlet was struggling operationally.\n\nThe experience itself was still manageable, but there is definitely room for improvement in consistency and attention to detail.",
          "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVnP5mGX3BD82Zrya9M9Hlj8JngUVbveMsLLiCyHtrERbKOWJ8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6"
        },
        {
          "author": "Tay Tiow Boon",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "Visited Gardens By The Bay yesterday.  Had lunch at McDonald. Ordered 2 sets of  2pcs Chicken + Large Sprite + Large Fries. Restaurant packed with Tourist & Locals.  About $12/set (/Pax)\n\nService Staff Mr. Nicholas was very friendly & helpful; going all out in providing great services. Highly commendable.\n\nChicken Sets delivered fast.  No wait.\nGreat lunch.  Many thanks to Nic.",
          "relativeTime": "3 weeks ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKUarjtsIeWP9Plq1QExS6c7U9qzgkk_K7KTCZ7svhXg68XZw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
        },
