      "reviews": [
        {
          "author": "G Z",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "Our furkid's regular groomer moved to sunset way, so we had a good 2 hours to our meal. The restaurant was pleasant and not too crowded on a Saturday and the manager came by to chat with us periodically. We ordered the  salted egg crab, \"green dragon veggie\" (青龙菜) and crabmeat fried rice. The first two were fantastic, but the crabmeat fried rice was a tad disappointing with barely any crabmeat and a lot of salted egg and century egg. Service was great as well and you get 10% off as a member! Will definitely return again the next time we bring our dog for grooming.",
          "relativeTime": "8 months ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWypSDzQl73fH2rZColEbKgKp7VCKl5IjZeHEo2pnp4SncjSGqH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
        },
        {
          "author": "Sik Siaw Yan",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "Truly enjoyed the food here at a reasonable price. Every dish was flavorful and nicely prepared. The portions were generous and definitely worth the price. The staff here friendly,attentive and make us feel very welcomed throughout the meal. A great dining experience would definately come back again👍",
          "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLCh7HH4LlhixPWtVgnZiSg0CPnibY2-AtTjv6Qb7lMT42bpQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
        },
        {
          "author": "admen Lim",
          "rating": 4,
          "text": "Food is alright total spend $280+++\n\nService seem abit shortage of manpower\n\nOrder raise hand no one attend not once but few time ended up need to go collect myself\n\nOrder food cannot speak Chinese only Malays …. English also abit don’t understand…. Very surprise..\n\nFood was ok nothing much to complaint .. price was acceptable but with the amount spend I think can get better service and better food .\n\nThe chicken is abit dry and hard the rest are ok\n\nFirst time there … not sure will go again .",
          "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXeI5ThloBZoh22MLSXANz_sWcTUVWVtWe6NwAi_Vp4YeWAf5pF=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7"
        },
        {
          "author": "Rishika Roy",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "That one thing which is very important for us is dining with our Gelato, our toy poodle. This place is extremely good with excellent seafood option. The staff is great and friendly. We enjoyed the food and the ambience.",
          "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWGJ2FAxM0ejrcDHoir5lsnLSFvdpe5qFDEpZSbv9WN8_GjTSZ5eg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
        },
        {
          "author": "Kenneth Kan",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "Every dish is impressive. We tried the golden sauce (pumpkin) sri lankan crab, salted egg eggplants and cereal prawns.  The restaurant is honest and lets you choose the seafood with transparent prices and gave good advice. The staff is extremely friendly and a lot of people come to the restaurant for birthday celebrations.\n\nYou cannot miss the dessert. Both durian and coconut pudding are so fragrant, smooth and creamy. It is better to make reservations or even call the restaurant to reserve the crabs.",
          "relativeTime": "a year ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJXsDTAQ1SEiDxLlE9e_HveHDDHxoOvVNYzeUJQk3s8bghCnQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
        }
      ]
    },
