      "reviews": [
        {
          "author": "alky",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "Really like the atmosphere of this place. The service was very good and the food was tasty as well! Really like the som tam, it was flavourful and tasty with the right amount of spice. Olive fried rice was solid as well! The drunken noodles had a good amount of wok hei but I wished the flavour was a little stronger. But overall, a pretty satisfying meal!!",
          "relativeTime": "a month ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXy4uwAqjhd9P2v5_YEY2TPDKToIhjfCBZy6dc0VU35-ohBvhs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
        },
        {
          "author": "Aiwen Huang",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "Really enjoyed the set meal! Great value for money, with generous portions and a nice variety of dishes. Everything was delicious and freshly prepared. The service was friendly and the overall dining experience was excellent. Definitely worth trying, and I’ll be coming back again!",
          "relativeTime": "a week ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKcXcGwNrBmayWjs3nINbreAjB582Q1aN81W6zaYELOLjkPtQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
        },
        {
          "author": "Teck Chong Law",
          "rating": 3,
          "text": "The set lunch is indeed value for money.  One main + two sides + one drink for $12.90 👍\n\nThe taste of the food was just average.\n\nThe aircon was not strong enough, so the restaurant was quite warm, and the aircon was making this weird sound throughout our meal.",
          "relativeTime": "a month ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV4T4j8ZZDc1RnbLe8accMbK-Vvmsgg-4gAYNyTuoMrehclwbHXEg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7"
        },
        {
          "author": "Eugene Leong",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "The portions for the set are quite large, and could feed more than specified.\n\nLoved the deep fried kang kong. It came w a sauce that helped to neutralise the greasiness.\n\nThe pork meat of the green curry was soft and chewy.\n\nEnded off with the coconut ice cream which was extremely refreshing to end with!\n\nThe dining area was spacious for dinner between 7-8pm. All in all a great meal!",
          "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSAAgmfzYLGx5z6sSZoc4defn-Z6CL6SRtLpAwn6pHnSuxamkW=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
        },
        {
          "author": "Tim Chen",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "Hands down some of the most delicious Thai food in the area! The flavors are vibrant and authentic, and having beer and wine on the menu makes it the perfect dinner spot. A special shoutout to Nana and Ella—they are exceptionally friendly, fun, and make you feel right at home from the moment you walk in. Can’t wait to come back!",
          "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
          "profilePhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVCZ5Aqep_2rup-kM4hhrTqtDCj_NlYQlzyl-H-vgjxnVhQGRI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
        }
      ]
    }
